# Spider-Slayer, Hatred Honed: any damage is enough, even one point (CR 603.2, 120.3). Bot1's Slayer (2/1) attacks and Bot2 blocks with both
# Giant Spider (a 2/4 Spider) and Llanowar Elves (a 1/1 that is no Spider). Bot1 divides the Slayer's 2 damage 1 and 1 (CR 510.1): the Giant Spider,
# a long way from lethal, is destroyed by the trigger, the Elves die of their 1, and the Slayer dies of the 3 it takes.

